WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪ Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away ♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪ Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway ♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪ Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free ♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪ If time would spare me
just one breath to stay ♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪ If you could see
the depth of my belief ♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪ Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me ♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪ Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form ♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪ I've walked
through life and death before ♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪ I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause ♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪ In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed ♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪ But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost ♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪ Forged in stardust and flame ♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪ I rise with an unyielding frame ♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 8=

01:46.800 --> 01:48.000
Open all those cabinets.

01:48.160 --> 01:49.200
Don't miss out on any corner.

01:49.280 --> 01:50.240
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

02:13.160 --> 02:15.600
I was only here to amuse myself.

02:16.400 --> 02:17.600
I didn't expect you to prepare

02:17.680 --> 02:18.920
such a great show for me.

02:19.600 --> 02:21.280
It was fantastic.

02:21.680 --> 02:22.720
Wasn't it, Wuyin?

02:28.520 --> 02:30.760
Jinyin Gambling House welcomes everyone.

02:31.200 --> 02:32.520
If you can come to have fun,

02:32.960 --> 02:34.200
as your brother,

02:35.200 --> 02:36.120
I can come here, too.

02:39.040 --> 02:40.120
You're right.

02:41.320 --> 02:43.440
It's fifty thousand taels of gold
we're talking about.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.720
Who wouldn't want to join this?

02:45.360 --> 02:47.360
The money in the Jinyin Gambling House

02:47.800 --> 02:48.760
is even more

02:49.480 --> 02:50.880
compared to the treasury.

02:52.560 --> 02:55.200
Shouldn't we invite Father
to enjoy the fun as well?

03:00.880 --> 03:01.400
Wuyin,

03:01.680 --> 03:02.280
shall we leave?

03:03.880 --> 03:04.640
Let's go.

03:12.640 --> 03:14.080
Huaijin, what do we do?

03:14.800 --> 03:16.440
Wuhen and Wuyin aren't that tight.

03:16.760 --> 03:18.200
But they suddenly showed up here now,

03:18.800 --> 03:20.080
they must be plotting against me.

03:20.640 --> 03:22.000
If they report what happened today

03:22.080 --> 03:23.160
to Father,

03:23.440 --> 03:24.360
what am I to do?

03:24.560 --> 03:25.120
Your Highness,

03:26.520 --> 03:27.640
stay composed.

03:28.600 --> 03:29.280
As for now,

03:29.840 --> 03:31.040
we can only give up on the plan

03:31.160 --> 03:32.000
and destroy this place.

03:32.080 --> 03:33.200
Don't worry, Your Highness.

03:33.280 --> 03:34.440
I'll take care of everything.

04:26.760 --> 04:28.040
They burn the whole place down.

04:32.360 --> 04:33.440
What about those silver?

04:44.240 --> 04:45.680
Fire can't burn real gold and silver.

04:46.480 --> 04:47.920
Only the ledgers and related evidence

04:48.680 --> 04:49.440
will be burned.

04:51.080 --> 04:53.600
That vault contains a shocking amount
of counterfeit money.

04:54.960 --> 04:55.960
If it all gets out,

04:56.840 --> 04:58.280
the consequences could be disastrous.

05:00.040 --> 05:01.120
Thankfully, after tonight,

05:02.120 --> 05:03.640
Prince Wugou will lay low for a while.

05:05.760 --> 05:06.320
Burning it all

05:06.720 --> 05:07.880
might be a good solution.

05:11.080 --> 05:12.720
How will you explain to
His Majesty then?

05:15.720 --> 05:16.680
With all this commotion,

05:17.520 --> 05:19.080
His Majesty will surely make a decision.

05:19.760 --> 05:20.320
Besides,

05:21.440 --> 05:22.880
with two princes as witnesses,

05:23.880 --> 05:25.120
it all depends on him to decide.

05:29.800 --> 05:31.240
This matter has been settled then.

05:50.680 --> 05:51.680
Poor judgment on my part.

05:52.000 --> 05:53.320
It has nothing to do with Huaijin.

05:53.480 --> 05:54.160
Right Chancellor,

05:54.440 --> 05:55.480
please stop punishing him.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.440
You're worrying too much, Your Highness.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.200
You are

06:04.760 --> 06:05.720
the royal family.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.600
Everything you say and do

06:08.040 --> 06:09.000
represents the Heaven.

06:10.320 --> 06:11.400
How could you ever be wrong?

06:15.760 --> 06:16.640
Huaijin

06:17.400 --> 06:19.320
was your study companion as a child

06:20.040 --> 06:21.600
and is now your aide.

06:22.120 --> 06:22.640
You and he

06:23.120 --> 06:24.160
share both glory

06:24.280 --> 06:25.160
and disgrace together.

06:26.200 --> 06:27.080
Of course,

06:27.400 --> 06:29.120
you won't abandon him
for a better choice.

06:29.840 --> 06:30.640
Clearly,

06:30.840 --> 06:31.960
all the mistakes

06:32.280 --> 06:33.080
must be his

06:33.240 --> 06:34.480
alone.

06:37.160 --> 06:38.840
He did advise me,
but I refused to listen.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.640
I was reckless

06:40.800 --> 06:41.880
and insisted on doing that.

06:42.960 --> 06:44.080
When you two make a mistake,

06:45.520 --> 06:46.800
His Majesty won't depose you,

06:47.240 --> 06:49.040
but he will take it out
on the Meng family.

06:53.760 --> 06:54.280
He

06:54.680 --> 06:56.600
is the eldest legitimate son
of the Meng family.

06:57.600 --> 06:58.280
He didn't stop you

06:58.360 --> 07:00.440
and has dragged
the entire Meng family down with him.

07:00.520 --> 07:01.560
He's to blame.

07:11.720 --> 07:12.400
Uncle.

07:16.320 --> 07:16.840
Uncle,

07:17.760 --> 07:19.680
Huaijin has always been weak
since he was a kid.

07:20.640 --> 07:21.400
It's all my fault.

07:21.600 --> 07:22.840
Please stop punishing him.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.560
If someone must be beaten, let it be me.

07:25.160 --> 07:25.800
Stop it.

07:47.560 --> 07:49.640
Now you care about your cousin,

07:50.240 --> 07:51.280
why didn't you think of him

07:51.520 --> 07:52.320
and the Meng family

07:52.640 --> 07:54.120
while you were at it?

07:56.520 --> 07:58.360
Do you really think your position

07:58.680 --> 07:59.800
is so secure?

08:04.920 --> 08:07.520
The Qin and Duan families are eyeing it.

08:09.520 --> 08:10.840
Consort Lan

08:11.160 --> 08:12.520
is still in favor of His Majesty.

08:13.520 --> 08:14.640
If she were to bear more sons

08:15.120 --> 08:16.560
and after seven or eight years,

08:17.480 --> 08:19.760
everything in Qi would change
in an instant.

08:22.000 --> 08:22.560
Uncle,

08:23.600 --> 08:24.480
Wuhen

08:25.000 --> 08:26.080
saw everything today.

08:27.080 --> 08:27.840
What should we do?

08:34.880 --> 08:35.520
Huaijin.

08:36.799 --> 08:37.320
Yes, Father.

08:37.880 --> 08:39.039
Make a list

08:39.640 --> 08:40.799
of all the nobles and officials

08:40.880 --> 08:43.320
who have left records
at the gambling house over these years.

08:44.039 --> 08:44.880
You and I

08:45.520 --> 08:46.880
will have to pay them a call.

08:49.520 --> 08:50.040
Yes, Father.

08:50.960 --> 08:52.240
Wasn't running the gambling house

08:53.320 --> 08:53.920
supposed to be

08:55.560 --> 08:57.080
part of our future cause?

08:59.640 --> 09:00.240
Wugou,

09:01.600 --> 09:04.000
the counterfeit money
concerns the livelihood of the people.

09:04.680 --> 09:06.200
If Prince Wuhen exposes this,

09:06.560 --> 09:07.960
even His Majesty can't protect you.

09:09.960 --> 09:11.120
In times like this,

09:11.520 --> 09:13.440
we must pull all those officials
and dignitaries

09:13.720 --> 09:14.240
into this.

09:14.320 --> 09:15.600
We'll sink, they'll sink with us.

09:16.920 --> 09:17.520
Only then

09:19.160 --> 09:21.160
will they defend you wholeheartedly.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.960
I must make those who ruined my plan

09:27.720 --> 09:29.400
pay the price.

09:31.440 --> 09:32.240
They will.

09:33.600 --> 09:34.480
But for now,

09:35.800 --> 09:37.320
we deal with this first.

09:49.880 --> 09:53.360
(Memorandum)

09:53.440 --> 09:56.720
(Mu Wuhen's seal)

09:59.080 --> 09:59.960
Your Majesty, I've found

10:00.040 --> 10:01.160
that the Jinyin Gambling House

10:01.240 --> 10:03.280
is a major hub
for circulating counterfeit money.

10:03.560 --> 10:05.400
Following the trail
to track down the source

10:05.800 --> 10:06.440
isn't difficult.

10:12.520 --> 10:14.240
Wuhen submitted this
one step ahead of you.

10:15.320 --> 10:15.840
Read this.

10:28.240 --> 10:29.440
Prince Wuhen

10:29.640 --> 10:30.320
is fast.

10:35.560 --> 10:36.520
So many people

10:37.040 --> 10:38.200
and this much money involved.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.080
It can't be done in a day.

10:40.640 --> 10:42.280
He must've been watching
for a long time.

10:42.560 --> 10:43.880
He knew it all along

10:44.640 --> 10:45.760
and simply used this chance

10:46.360 --> 10:47.880
to strike at Wugou's weak spot.

10:49.840 --> 10:51.200
What's your decision, Your Majesty?

10:54.120 --> 10:55.600
There are only over 200 officials

10:55.680 --> 10:56.720
above the third rank in Qi.

10:58.040 --> 10:58.720
This list alone

10:59.080 --> 11:00.600
contains nearly a hundred names.

11:02.360 --> 11:03.360
The money involved

11:03.880 --> 11:05.920
is almost equal to
last year's tax revenue.

11:06.720 --> 11:07.960
And even those not on the list,

11:08.120 --> 11:08.960
how many of them

11:09.960 --> 11:10.920
will stand by and watch

11:11.000 --> 11:12.000
like Wuhen,

11:13.400 --> 11:14.440
waiting for others to fall

11:15.400 --> 11:17.000
so they can swoop in for their benefits?

11:19.280 --> 11:20.880
Even if I punish them now,

11:21.800 --> 11:22.880
there will be a new list

11:23.440 --> 11:24.840
presented to me

11:25.080 --> 11:25.640
like this

11:26.280 --> 11:27.360
a few years later.

11:29.400 --> 11:30.200
So, Chancellor Shen,

11:31.120 --> 11:31.920
let me ask you.

11:32.920 --> 11:33.600
Should I

11:34.960 --> 11:36.840
continue to investigate this?

11:51.240 --> 11:53.920
Your Majesty appointed me to investigate
the counterfeit money case

11:54.480 --> 11:56.200
to stabilize the livelihood
of the people.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.240
If it causes an upheaval
in the imperial court,

11:58.320 --> 12:00.120
that would go against
your original purpose.

12:02.800 --> 12:03.560
As for the heir,

12:04.280 --> 12:05.600
I believe he will restrain himself

12:06.080 --> 12:06.720
after this.

12:13.480 --> 12:14.960
If so, let's put an end to it here.

12:27.520 --> 12:28.600
The evidence was conclusive,

12:28.680 --> 12:30.000
yet they just let it go so easily.

12:33.160 --> 12:34.400
Prince Wugou came out unscathed.

12:34.960 --> 12:36.040
Merely a few reprimands

12:36.120 --> 12:37.280
and minor punishments.

12:39.160 --> 12:39.880
Still, this incident

12:39.960 --> 12:42.560
took a toll on the connections
the Meng family has carefully built

12:42.640 --> 12:43.480
for years

12:44.360 --> 12:46.040
and alerted His Majesty.

12:47.440 --> 12:48.680
Besides, the position of the heir

12:48.760 --> 12:50.080
is no longer unshakable.

12:51.200 --> 12:52.840
That, I've achieved my goal.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.360
The Qi has a hundred years of history,

12:56.440 --> 12:58.880
but those noble families
have survived through several reigns.

13:00.000 --> 13:00.720
By now,

13:00.800 --> 13:03.040
the entire imperial court
is tied up in a complicated web.

13:03.120 --> 13:04.080
Almost all the officials

13:04.680 --> 13:06.600
are either their descendants
or proteges.

13:08.680 --> 13:11.400
His Majesty has attempted a few times
to raise up men of humble origin

13:11.480 --> 13:15.520
to balance them out,
but it's never truly worked.

13:33.480 --> 13:35.840
This tea is named Sweet Aftertaste.

13:36.840 --> 13:39.360
Bitter at first, the sweetness slowly
grows stronger afterward.

13:41.120 --> 13:42.480
It's grown in the Min Region.

13:43.720 --> 13:45.200
Due to its difficulty in harvesting,

13:45.560 --> 13:47.600
so it's rare.

13:48.800 --> 13:49.720
If you like it,

13:49.800 --> 13:51.560
you can order them to send up
all the stock.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.120
No matter how rare it is,

13:53.200 --> 13:55.480
surely there's enough for you,
Your Majesty.

13:57.640 --> 13:59.120
Each year, local officials

13:59.880 --> 14:03.160
send thirty percent of the harvest
to the palace,

14:04.600 --> 14:05.720
twenty percent

14:06.000 --> 14:07.040
is used for bribes,

14:07.680 --> 14:08.720
and the rest

14:09.240 --> 14:11.680
is all delivered straight
to the Right Chancellor's residence.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.840
When jackals circle,

14:18.960 --> 14:20.120
even the finest tea

14:21.400 --> 14:22.560
loses its fragrance.

14:28.400 --> 14:28.920
Father,

14:29.400 --> 14:30.840
we were summoned to the palace today.

14:31.280 --> 14:33.440
But His Majesty didn't punish
Prince Wugou or our family

14:33.520 --> 14:34.960
because of Prince Wuhen's memorandum.

14:36.240 --> 14:38.080
Instead, he ordered you

14:38.360 --> 14:39.920
to gather funds from all noble families.

14:40.520 --> 14:42.000
What is His Majesty's true intention?

14:43.480 --> 14:44.680
This is the price

14:45.040 --> 14:46.920
His Majesty set for the Meng family

14:47.520 --> 14:49.240
to settle the counterfeit money case.

14:50.040 --> 14:51.600
As the head of all noble families,

14:52.240 --> 14:53.480
we need to patch the hole

14:53.880 --> 14:55.640
it left behind.

14:58.400 --> 14:59.160
So,

14:59.760 --> 15:01.000
you must stop your foolish cousin

15:01.080 --> 15:03.240
from acting recklessly again.

15:03.880 --> 15:04.600
Yes, Father.

15:06.400 --> 15:07.560
(The sword is drawn.)

15:08.040 --> 15:10.120
(How can it be sheathed without blood?)

15:12.320 --> 15:13.240
(The Thousand Peaks Map)

15:13.320 --> 15:14.920
(must be hiding an even greater secret.)

15:15.720 --> 15:17.160
(Once the truth comes to light,)

15:17.960 --> 15:18.800
(Meng Zhongyan,)

15:19.920 --> 15:21.560
(how else will you escape?)

15:32.840 --> 15:34.440
You saved Qingtai as you promised.

15:35.280 --> 15:37.240
Certainly, I'll hand the map over
to you.

15:56.760 --> 15:59.080
If you're worried the map
has been tampered with,

15:59.920 --> 16:01.280
you may ask Madam.

16:02.080 --> 16:03.160
In this household,

16:03.760 --> 16:04.400
aside from me,

16:04.840 --> 16:06.760
she's the most familiar with it.

16:09.480 --> 16:11.160
Lady Jiang, you didn't hesitate
this time.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.120
But

16:14.480 --> 16:16.280
how do you expect me to trust

16:16.920 --> 16:18.640
you didn't alter the map again?

16:20.120 --> 16:21.440
It concerns Qingtai's safety,

16:22.000 --> 16:24.000
I would never do anything
that endangers her life.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.120
Please rest assured.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.600
If there's nothing else,

16:33.320 --> 16:34.360
I'll take my leave.

16:58.040 --> 16:59.280
Is this real?

17:00.920 --> 17:01.800
We can't be sure yet.

17:02.840 --> 17:04.079
This woman is cunning.

17:05.160 --> 17:06.839
Who knows what trick she'll pull?

17:08.319 --> 17:11.079
Why did you give the vile chancellor the
complete Sunlight over a Thousand Peaks

17:11.160 --> 17:11.800
but give Miss Yang

17:11.880 --> 17:13.119
only a half map?

17:13.440 --> 17:14.920
I don't know what Empress Lv is after,

17:15.280 --> 17:16.520
I'm just following her orders.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.839
If I uncover the truth before she does,

17:19.280 --> 17:20.400
I'll have the whole picture

17:20.480 --> 17:22.000
to find out what her real intention is,

17:23.000 --> 17:24.880
then I can gain leverage

17:25.440 --> 17:26.560
and save Changjue.

17:27.760 --> 17:30.360
So you're using the vile chancellor
to investigate?

17:32.280 --> 17:33.360
Well done.

17:34.680 --> 17:35.200
Later,

17:35.520 --> 17:36.520
I'll go to Lan Boutique.

17:36.960 --> 17:37.960
Wait for me outside.

17:38.520 --> 17:39.840
If anything happens,

17:40.400 --> 17:41.240
act accordingly.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.800
Don't worry, Your Highness.

18:00.880 --> 18:01.720
Your Highness,

18:02.680 --> 18:04.000
calm down.

18:09.000 --> 18:09.600
Your Highness.

18:09.720 --> 18:10.920
Please spare me, Your Highness!

18:11.480 --> 18:12.280
You servant!

18:12.720 --> 18:13.560
What did you say?

18:14.040 --> 18:15.240
Please spare me, Your Highness!

18:15.480 --> 18:17.120
Everyone keeps telling me to endure.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.200
I've endured until now.

18:18.760 --> 18:19.720
Even a servant

18:20.240 --> 18:21.720
dares to disrespect me!

18:22.200 --> 18:22.720
Huh?

18:27.560 --> 18:28.520
Why are you waiting for?

18:29.320 --> 18:29.960
Open the window!

18:30.640 --> 18:31.720
Trying to suffocate me?

18:32.680 --> 18:33.480
Yes, Your Highness.

18:37.880 --> 18:39.760
(Lan Boutique)

18:39.840 --> 18:41.960
Many eyes are on that map right now.

18:42.640 --> 18:45.000
That vile chancellor hides it
in his study

18:45.560 --> 18:47.520
and guards it like it's his own eyeball.

18:47.880 --> 18:48.880
For this half of the map,

18:49.120 --> 18:50.960
I risked house arrest

18:51.240 --> 18:53.440
just to get into his study
with an excuse.

18:55.720 --> 18:57.600
Don't you have a perfect memory,
Your Highness?

18:58.160 --> 18:59.280
Why only half?

19:00.000 --> 19:01.280
That vile chancellor is cautious.

19:01.840 --> 19:03.800
He closed the map
the moment he heard a sound.

19:04.280 --> 19:05.600
This is all I managed to see.

19:15.120 --> 19:17.400
Aside from the seal
of the gambling house,

19:18.360 --> 19:19.560
nothing else is helpful.

19:22.280 --> 19:24.040
After hearing what you said last time,

19:24.320 --> 19:25.600
I've been watching in the residence

19:25.680 --> 19:27.160
for Her Highness's sake.

19:28.800 --> 19:29.880
I found out that…

19:41.680 --> 19:42.400
(What's that?)

19:45.080 --> 19:46.240
(The pattern on her arm.)

19:49.120 --> 19:51.360
(She's the woman who gambled
with me yesterday.)

19:55.480 --> 19:58.000
Prince Wugou is the mastermind
behind the Jinyin Gambling House.

19:59.840 --> 20:01.880
Though it's not publicly known,

20:02.240 --> 20:05.040
it's an open secret
among all dignitaries of Yujing.

20:06.760 --> 20:08.520
What does Her Highness wish to know?

20:09.080 --> 20:10.040
I'll try to find out.

20:13.600 --> 20:16.080
Anyway, there's something
hidden in this map.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.600
Find a way to keep an eye on Shen Zaiye

20:18.960 --> 20:20.280
and see what he's been to lately.

20:22.320 --> 20:22.840
Yes.

20:27.240 --> 20:28.640
This is the antidote for this month.

20:38.080 --> 20:38.640
Move aside!

20:38.720 --> 20:39.800
- We're arresting a criminal!
- Move.

20:39.880 --> 20:40.960
- Don't block the way.
- Move.

20:41.320 --> 20:41.960
Hurry and leave.

20:42.440 --> 20:42.960
Get out.

20:43.120 --> 20:44.520
Is this a mistake, sir?

20:44.880 --> 20:46.160
There's no criminal here.

20:49.280 --> 20:50.440
(Why is Prince Wugou here?)

20:51.320 --> 20:52.240
(Did he see me?)

20:53.800 --> 20:54.520
By all means, sir.

20:59.080 --> 21:00.080
(I must leave quickly.)

21:14.720 --> 21:15.880
Please behave, Your Highness.

21:35.760 --> 21:37.040
Please let her go, Your Highness.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.440
She's Chancellor Shen's woman.

21:38.520 --> 21:39.920
Offending him could be troublesome.

21:46.760 --> 21:47.920
As the heir of the state,

21:48.560 --> 21:49.480
you openly humiliate

21:50.040 --> 21:51.760
a minister's womanfolk.

21:53.560 --> 21:54.760
How could Prince Wugou do that?

21:54.920 --> 21:56.240
Is this the etiquette of Qi?

21:57.000 --> 21:58.920
The heir behaving so disgracefully.

21:59.320 --> 22:00.240
Keep it down.

22:00.320 --> 22:01.680
Though I'm a woman,

22:02.200 --> 22:03.600
I understand dignity and propriety.

22:04.440 --> 22:05.760
If you think I'm guilty,

22:06.240 --> 22:07.240
then arrest me

22:08.680 --> 22:09.880
and accuse me

22:10.080 --> 22:11.160
in front of all officials,

22:11.760 --> 22:13.320
your father,

22:13.400 --> 22:14.440
and all the people.

22:19.200 --> 22:20.360
Qingtai, let's leave.

22:23.480 --> 22:24.000
(Wait.)

22:26.120 --> 22:26.680
(That voice.)

22:27.520 --> 22:28.440
For the last round,

22:29.080 --> 22:30.000
I bet on myself.

22:31.040 --> 22:31.600
It was her.

22:32.360 --> 22:32.960
Capture her!

22:33.240 --> 22:34.320
Tell Shen Zaiye to ransom her.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.160
Yes, Your Highness.

22:38.680 --> 22:39.200
Give chase!

22:42.440 --> 22:43.480
Qingtai, let's split up.

22:43.560 --> 22:44.080
All right.

22:45.560 --> 22:46.240
Stop right there.

22:47.440 --> 22:48.160
Stop right there.

22:58.440 --> 22:59.200
It's going to rain.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.960
We need to leave the city before dark.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.280
- Split up.
- Yes, sir.

23:21.560 --> 23:22.160
The guard reports

23:22.240 --> 23:24.600
they've searched the entire city
but couldn't find Jiang Taohua.

23:24.680 --> 23:26.640
If she escapes the city,
it'll be hard to catch.

23:28.560 --> 23:29.520
Hard to catch?

23:30.080 --> 23:31.800
Then what do I need
you useless fools for?

23:32.600 --> 23:34.240
Should we inform Mr. Meng?

23:35.760 --> 23:36.760
Huaijin is cautious.

23:37.960 --> 23:39.560
I know what to do. Don't bother him.

23:41.040 --> 23:42.360
Send more men to the mountains.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.360
Tell them

23:45.200 --> 23:46.280
that if they can't find her,

23:47.520 --> 23:48.920
they don't have to come back.

24:03.240 --> 24:04.040
(I've run this far)

24:04.120 --> 24:05.400
(and they're still chasing me.)

24:07.400 --> 24:09.000
(Prince Wugou isn't going to let me go.)

24:10.800 --> 24:12.720
(I must think of a way
to shake them off.)

24:17.720 --> 24:18.440
Chancellor!

24:18.880 --> 24:19.840
Open the door, Chancellor!

24:19.920 --> 24:20.440
What's wrong?

24:20.520 --> 24:22.200
Prince Wugou is hunting down
Her Highness.

24:24.360 --> 24:26.560
Today, she went to a shop
to pick out clothes

24:26.640 --> 24:27.640
and ran into Prince Wugou.

24:27.720 --> 24:29.280
Then Prince Wugou
claimed that Her Highness

24:29.360 --> 24:30.920
was the one he gambled with that night.

24:31.320 --> 24:32.960
Please save Her Highness.

24:33.240 --> 24:35.600
Prince Wugou's men have already
chased her outside the city.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.280
Please save her.

24:38.680 --> 24:40.000
Lady Jiang is clever.

24:40.880 --> 24:42.120
I don't think she needs help.

24:57.680 --> 24:58.720
His Highness gave an order.

24:58.840 --> 24:59.960
Bring her back at all costs.

25:00.520 --> 25:01.240
Search carefully.

25:36.160 --> 25:37.280
That's the woman's garment.

25:38.080 --> 25:39.720
She might be tricking us.
We'll split up.

25:40.560 --> 25:41.080
Follow me.

25:41.160 --> 25:42.080
The rest, go that way.

26:22.080 --> 26:22.840
His Highness

26:23.200 --> 26:24.760
wants her brought back, dead or alive.

26:27.760 --> 26:29.840
(Ever since I came to Qi
for the marriage alliance,)

26:31.160 --> 26:32.760
(I have to put myself on the line,)

26:33.680 --> 26:36.040
(plotting each step with care.)

26:37.600 --> 26:39.240
(Yet my life's still at the mercy)

26:40.320 --> 26:42.080
(of those in power.)

26:44.320 --> 26:44.840
(No.)

26:46.320 --> 26:47.760
(I must stay alive.)

26:54.240 --> 26:55.080
There are footprints.

27:46.160 --> 27:46.680
Be careful.

27:49.560 --> 27:50.120
Thank you.

28:05.960 --> 28:06.560
Send more men.

28:07.240 --> 28:07.760
Search!

28:08.120 --> 28:08.640
Yes, sir.

28:09.080 --> 28:09.760
Someone's there.

28:15.080 --> 28:15.640
Search inside.

28:15.720 --> 28:16.720
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

28:17.800 --> 28:18.800
There's sound over there.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.480
What's that smell?

29:11.840 --> 29:13.840
Could it be a wild beast's lair?

29:14.480 --> 29:15.440
Should we just leave it?

30:08.640 --> 30:09.440
Nothing here.

30:10.040 --> 30:11.040
Let's check over there.

30:24.520 --> 30:25.040
You…

30:30.680 --> 30:31.440
It's not poisonous.

30:32.080 --> 30:32.600
I won't die.

30:38.640 --> 30:39.480
Chancellor,

30:40.400 --> 30:42.000
did you especially come here
to save me?

30:46.880 --> 30:47.440
Of course not.

30:48.520 --> 30:50.560
I haven't verified
the authenticity of the map yet.

30:52.160 --> 30:52.760
If you die,

30:52.840 --> 30:54.880
I'll have to start
the counterfeit money investigation

30:54.960 --> 30:55.760
all over again.

30:56.600 --> 30:57.120
So,

30:58.160 --> 30:59.040
you can't die.

31:04.040 --> 31:04.560
As I thought,

31:05.240 --> 31:06.480
only those who are useful

31:06.880 --> 31:07.720
are worth saving.

31:41.800 --> 31:42.600
Don't overthink it.

31:43.800 --> 31:44.560
If you fall ill,

31:45.440 --> 31:46.760
I'll have to waste even more effort

31:46.840 --> 31:47.920
to get you out of the woods.

31:48.920 --> 31:49.680
Don't catch a cold.

32:23.000 --> 32:23.520
Wolves.

32:28.840 --> 32:29.640
Where are you going?

32:29.920 --> 32:30.920
I'll stand guard outside.

32:41.320 --> 32:42.640
(Stand guard outside?)

32:43.920 --> 32:44.960
(Is a map)

32:45.600 --> 32:47.000
(worth the Left Chancellor)

32:47.080 --> 32:48.080
(risking his life?)

33:01.520 --> 33:06.760
♪ I'm lost for words when you turn away ♪

33:07.640 --> 33:13.960
♪ The closer our fluttering hearts
draw near, the more they try to hide ♪

33:15.440 --> 33:21.640
♪ The deeper my thoughts grow
for you at night ♪

33:22.120 --> 33:27.200
♪ The more afraid I am of losing you ♪

33:28.920 --> 33:32.160
♪ Those simple, ordinary days ♪

33:32.240 --> 33:35.080
♪ Feel like a dream of mine ♪

33:36.000 --> 33:39.240
♪ Humble meals a day ♪

33:39.320 --> 33:41.840
♪ Far away from worldly concerns ♪

33:42.960 --> 33:46.640
♪ Those memories become clear over time ♪

33:46.880 --> 33:49.960
♪ The long night passes in a flash ♪

33:50.120 --> 33:53.400
♪ Two hearts slowly connect ♪

33:53.640 --> 33:57.320
♪ They dance joyfully ♪

34:01.440 --> 34:02.040
Chancellor,

34:02.760 --> 34:04.240
are we going back to the residence?

34:04.320 --> 34:05.200
We can't go back yet.

34:06.080 --> 34:07.680
Prince Wugou couldn't find you
last night,

34:07.760 --> 34:08.880
he'll definitely send more men

34:08.960 --> 34:09.840
to hunt you down.

34:11.920 --> 34:13.199
Right now, we're alone and weak.

34:13.880 --> 34:15.239
We'll die if we show ourselves.

34:16.080 --> 34:17.920
We have to wait
until the reinforcements come.

34:19.560 --> 34:20.520
The forest is vast.

34:21.040 --> 34:22.880
Will Zhan Lu see these marks?

34:24.159 --> 34:25.040
As long as they come,

34:25.320 --> 34:26.040
they'll find them.

34:28.120 --> 34:29.239
So many bamboo shoots!

34:33.360 --> 34:34.040
Let's go.

34:48.560 --> 34:49.239
Who are you?

34:55.880 --> 34:56.639
Little girl,

34:57.680 --> 34:58.320
don't be afraid.

34:58.760 --> 34:59.800
We're not bad people.

35:00.000 --> 35:02.080
We came into the mountains to have fun
and got lost.

35:03.480 --> 35:04.200
We're sorry

35:04.400 --> 35:05.400
for scaring you just now.

35:07.640 --> 35:09.000
It's been raining every day lately,

35:09.480 --> 35:10.440
high-born like you

35:10.520 --> 35:11.560
wouldn't come here for fun.

35:12.040 --> 35:13.600
Got lost? You think you can fool me?

35:19.800 --> 35:20.400
Little girl,

35:20.920 --> 35:22.680
we did run into trouble.

35:23.120 --> 35:24.120
We didn't tell you earlier

35:24.200 --> 35:25.640
because we didn't want to scare you.

35:29.840 --> 35:30.720
This pair of earrings

35:30.960 --> 35:32.720
could buy a whole lot of bamboo shoots.

35:32.960 --> 35:33.480
Well,

35:34.080 --> 35:37.160
would you take us to your home
for some food?

35:37.640 --> 35:39.240
We'll leave once we freshen up.

35:39.640 --> 35:40.840
We won't cause you any trouble.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.160
You're young,

35:52.000 --> 35:53.120
but you're cunning.

35:55.880 --> 35:56.560
Little girl,

35:56.880 --> 35:58.480
we really don't want to cause trouble.

35:59.800 --> 36:00.960
Please help us.

36:01.600 --> 36:02.560
Besides, the earrings

36:03.040 --> 36:04.960
could feed your family for years.

36:05.640 --> 36:07.840
The likes of you are always pretentious.

36:08.400 --> 36:09.920
Who knows what you'll do

36:10.280 --> 36:11.640
once you come to my home?

36:12.160 --> 36:13.240
Do we have to pretend

36:14.120 --> 36:15.400
if we really want to hurt you?

36:26.680 --> 36:28.120
My house is right ahead.

36:28.200 --> 36:29.040
Keep your word.

36:29.160 --> 36:30.480
You'll only stay one day.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.280
Lian, you're back.

36:41.720 --> 36:42.600
Hello, Mr. Li.

36:42.800 --> 36:43.320
Hello.

36:46.640 --> 36:47.440
Hello, Madam Wang.

36:47.800 --> 36:48.800
You're back, Lian.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.440
Who are they?

36:52.600 --> 36:53.640
They're my guests.

37:05.200 --> 37:06.520
Granny, I'm home.

37:06.960 --> 37:07.600
Good.

37:08.720 --> 37:09.560
You must be hungry.

37:11.080 --> 37:11.800
Come on and eat.

37:13.840 --> 37:14.760
What's going on here?

37:15.120 --> 37:17.440
This lady and her husband
got lost in the mountains,

37:17.520 --> 37:18.840
so I brought them back.

37:18.920 --> 37:19.960
We've had a hard journey.

37:20.240 --> 37:22.120
Would you let us stay
to clean ourselves?

37:22.600 --> 37:24.080
My husband was bitten by a snake.

37:24.560 --> 37:26.640
Could you give us some hot water

37:27.120 --> 37:28.080
to clean his wound?

37:28.400 --> 37:30.240
You didn't ask for hot water earlier.

37:30.760 --> 37:31.920
So pretentious.

37:32.120 --> 37:34.520
Do you know how much firewood it takes
to heat the water?

37:35.320 --> 37:35.920
Lian,

37:36.280 --> 37:37.680
don't be rude.

37:40.360 --> 37:42.520
Everyone runs into trouble
when they travel.

37:43.280 --> 37:45.520
Mister, madam, you're too polite.

37:46.080 --> 37:48.320
You can have it if you need it.

37:55.680 --> 37:56.840
Mister,

37:57.280 --> 37:59.480
you look just like Lian's brother.

38:00.760 --> 38:02.880
I'm happy looking at you.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.440
How about this?

38:05.040 --> 38:05.920
You take a rest.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.000
Lian,

38:07.440 --> 38:08.640
take them to change clothes.

38:08.880 --> 38:09.880
I'll prepare some dishes.

38:10.080 --> 38:11.080
Let's eat later.

38:11.760 --> 38:12.400
Fine.

38:12.480 --> 38:13.200
Go ahead.

38:13.600 --> 38:14.600
Follow me.

38:17.200 --> 38:19.000
My brother is way more good-looking
than you.

39:05.880 --> 39:07.120
Come on and have a seat.

39:11.200 --> 39:13.600
Farmhouse dishes are nothing like
what you have in the city.

39:13.960 --> 39:14.720
Please try some.

39:15.080 --> 39:16.480
Where did you get the chicken from?

39:17.080 --> 39:18.560
Granny, did you slaughter the hen?

39:20.640 --> 39:22.320
Didn't you always want to eat it?

39:23.320 --> 39:24.080
Come, have some.

39:26.040 --> 39:28.960
But we're relying on the hen
to lay eggs to help us pay our debts.

39:30.600 --> 39:31.360
Well,

39:32.000 --> 39:33.680
they were hurt in the mountains.

39:33.760 --> 39:35.040
They can't just eat greens.

39:35.240 --> 39:35.760
Right?

39:38.080 --> 39:38.600
Here.

39:41.320 --> 39:41.840
Here.

39:43.960 --> 39:44.720
Have more.

39:46.000 --> 39:46.520
Thank you.

39:46.600 --> 39:48.000
You must be starving.

39:48.080 --> 39:48.600
Here you go.

39:49.240 --> 39:49.760
Thank you.

39:51.560 --> 39:52.080
Eat some.

39:58.120 --> 39:58.880
Come on and eat.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.280
No need.

40:01.360 --> 40:02.280
Lian, eat this.

40:06.240 --> 40:06.840
But…

40:10.320 --> 40:10.840
Delicious.

40:11.280 --> 40:12.640
Madam, your cooking is amazing.

40:12.920 --> 40:13.560
Really?

40:15.320 --> 40:15.960
Good to know.

40:18.160 --> 40:18.880
Please have more.

40:19.040 --> 40:19.760
Here, Lian.

40:19.880 --> 40:20.400
Lian.

40:21.080 --> 40:21.880
I'll do it.

40:22.920 --> 40:23.680
You can have it.

40:24.920 --> 40:25.560
Let me.

40:27.080 --> 40:27.920
Have more.

40:29.080 --> 40:30.720
Eat more if you like it.

40:34.960 --> 40:35.760
It smells great.

40:35.840 --> 40:36.640
Really?

40:36.880 --> 40:39.040
Don't worry, Granny.
I'll dig a lot of bamboo shoots

40:39.160 --> 40:41.000
and buy another chicken soon.

40:41.800 --> 40:42.320
All right.

40:42.760 --> 40:44.160
Good girl.

40:47.120 --> 40:50.680
Bowl, plate, rattle drum.
All kinds of things are for sale.

40:50.920 --> 40:53.080
Folded fan, bottle gourd,
vinegar, and rice liquor.

40:53.160 --> 40:54.120
Do you sell honey sweets?

40:54.200 --> 40:54.720
Yes.

40:55.040 --> 40:55.560
Five wen.

40:55.880 --> 40:57.320
Wasn't it two wen last time?

40:57.400 --> 40:58.360
It's five now.

40:58.800 --> 41:01.200
Bowl, plate, rattle drum,
folded fan, and bottle guard.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.640
We sell all kinds of things.

41:03.800 --> 41:04.720
Rice liquor.

41:04.800 --> 41:05.360
Excuse me.

41:05.440 --> 41:06.520
We sell everything.

41:07.960 --> 41:09.320
You don't seem local.

41:09.600 --> 41:10.440
What would you like?

41:12.200 --> 41:13.120
I'll pay for her.

41:13.800 --> 41:14.360
Sure.

41:14.440 --> 41:16.600
You think you can bribe me
with one candy?

41:17.840 --> 41:19.640
How about two?

41:20.800 --> 41:21.640
Still no.

41:25.160 --> 41:26.400
Give me a few more malt sugar.

41:27.160 --> 41:27.680
Sure.

41:27.840 --> 41:29.920
You're so kind-hearted.

41:30.720 --> 41:31.880
Here's an extra piece for you.

41:33.480 --> 41:35.160
Wait a moment. Let me get your change.

41:37.120 --> 41:37.880
Give it to me.

41:38.480 --> 41:39.080
We're together.

41:39.400 --> 41:40.040
I see.

41:40.280 --> 41:40.840
All right.

41:41.160 --> 41:41.880
I'm leaving now.

41:49.280 --> 41:50.280
You really won't take it?

41:52.280 --> 41:54.240
You ate and stayed for free at my house.

41:54.400 --> 41:56.720
It's no big deal, even if I take two.

42:02.080 --> 42:02.600
Let's go.

42:02.680 --> 42:03.400
Look at this.

42:05.760 --> 42:07.200
Something's wrong with this silver?

42:08.440 --> 42:09.880
Dear, we just ate.

42:10.000 --> 42:10.960
Shall we walk around

42:11.120 --> 42:11.640
in the village

42:11.720 --> 42:12.520
to help digestion?

42:19.800 --> 42:21.280
Come and have a look.

42:21.640 --> 42:22.520
We have fresh stock.

42:22.600 --> 42:23.320
Fresh stock?

42:23.400 --> 42:24.040
Yes.

42:24.360 --> 42:25.000
Let me see.

42:25.880 --> 42:26.600
Give me this one.

42:30.240 --> 42:31.480
All right, here's your change.

42:32.720 --> 42:33.240
Keep it safe.

42:33.880 --> 42:35.000
All right. What would you like?

42:35.080 --> 42:36.760
Mother, I want malt sugar.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.000
Me too.

42:50.480 --> 42:51.240
To think

42:51.880 --> 42:52.960
that counterfeit money

42:53.080 --> 42:54.560
appears in a remote village like this.

42:57.520 --> 42:58.800
Have you noticed anything strange

42:58.880 --> 43:00.120
about this village?

43:05.320 --> 43:06.320
It seems like

43:07.400 --> 43:08.600
there are no young men

43:08.960 --> 43:10.560
in this village.

43:12.480 --> 43:13.160
Right.

43:13.240 --> 43:15.320
There are only elderly people,
women, and children.

43:16.200 --> 43:17.680
No large fields either.

43:18.040 --> 43:19.960
Just a few women tending small gardens.

43:21.800 --> 43:24.280
The counterfeit money
is now circulating through this village,

43:24.960 --> 43:25.880
so I plan

43:26.680 --> 43:27.440
to stay a few days

43:28.080 --> 43:29.360
to find out what's going on.

43:30.360 --> 43:31.880
There are only women and children here.

43:31.960 --> 43:33.200
If you chat with them,

43:33.280 --> 43:34.760
they'll probably let their guard down.

43:39.680 --> 43:40.320
What about you?

43:42.240 --> 43:42.760
Me?

43:45.000 --> 43:46.920
I have something more important

43:47.000 --> 43:47.720
to do.

43:55.560 --> 43:56.680
(This is my chance.)

43:57.520 --> 43:58.080
(This time,)

43:58.680 --> 43:59.880
(I must use his power)

44:00.040 --> 44:02.240
(to uncover the secret
behind the Thousand Peaks Map.)

44:02.480 --> 44:04.280
(I won't allow any of you
to crush me again.)

44:22.640 --> 44:25.840
♪ The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all ♪

44:25.920 --> 44:28.960
♪ In splendor, proud and tall ♪

44:29.880 --> 44:33.040
♪ The flower fell, lashed by the wind ♪

44:33.120 --> 44:36.880
♪ In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned ♪

44:37.160 --> 44:40.280
♪ Petals soaked in rain ♪

44:40.360 --> 44:43.680
♪ Heartbreak follows again and again ♪

44:44.080 --> 44:47.640
♪ The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts ♪

44:47.720 --> 44:53.440
♪ With no one it can be brought ♪

44:58.400 --> 45:05.320
♪ Wishes struggle through the mire ♪

45:05.760 --> 45:12.600
♪ Regrets clash in hopeless fire ♪

45:13.080 --> 45:20.080
♪ Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew ♪

45:20.400 --> 45:24.480
♪ Even if it means this flower ♪

45:24.560 --> 45:31.520
♪ Will be hers to give to someone new ♪

45:42.640 --> 45:45.760
♪ Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet? ♪

45:45.840 --> 45:49.080
♪ Love and hate held back, discreet ♪

45:49.440 --> 45:53.160
♪ The flower withers, feelings in decay ♪

45:53.240 --> 45:59.800
♪ No longer needing to say ♪

46:03.880 --> 46:10.800
♪ Yet I still long for her in madness ♪

46:11.200 --> 46:18.160
♪ Unafraid of judgment or sadness ♪

46:18.520 --> 46:25.520
♪ Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies ♪

46:25.880 --> 46:27.560
♪ And finding ♪

46:27.640 --> 46:36.640
♪ They were her gentle heart's reply ♪
